-- a pair of polymorphs as data: one molecule, two solids, two space groups. Ritonavir's Form II is
-- this type inhabited, and it cost more than US$250 million and took the drug off the market.
PolymorphPair : Type 1
PolymorphPair = (A : Solid) × (B : Solid) × (solid-mol A ≡ solid-mol B) × ((solid-sg A ≡ solid-sg B) → Empty)
